<title>FRANCE: Aerospatiale ups 1996 profit estimate.</title>
<headline>Aerospatiale ups 1996 profit estimate.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>French state-owned Aerospatiale expects to post 1996 net profit of between 600-700 million francs, a company spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's more like 600-700 million francs,&quot; she said, clarifying remarks made by chairman Yves Michot who earlier told journalists the company expected to post 1996 full year net profit around twice the 273 million francs reported for the first half.</p>
<p>Michot earlier said 1996 sales would be roughly the same as 1995 of 49.2 billion francs &quot;within a few hundred million francs.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
